.DS_Store

# secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# local working notes
PROGRESS.md
_*.md

# Do not ship files that load into a reader's session or override their config.
# AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are read automatically by the agent in whatever
# directory it starts in, so committing ours would apply our working rules to
# theirs. A .codex/ directory is worse: project config takes precedence over the
# user's own once the repository is trusted.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.codex/
